        "316. 计算：",
        "а) $\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{-10}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{8}\\right)^4+\\left(\\frac{3}{7}\\right)^0:\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{-1}$；",
        "б) $\\left(\\frac{1}{9}\\right)^{-5}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{27}\\right)^4-\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^{10}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{81}\\right)^{-3}$。"
      ]
    },
